      statConsequences: []
      displayTexts:
      - 'You rally those around you with your voice. "Come together, Uncounted! Let''s
        show our strength!" The crowd rushes towards your side and collectively pushes
        the boulder. '
      - '"It''s moving!" They cry. The boulder creaks and groans until momentum finally
        takes hold of it. The boulder rolls onwards. The cheers quickly disappear
        as they see the remnants of its victims. '
      - Solemnly, they begin digging up graves for these crushed corpses. However,
        many privately thank you for this feat. The Head of the Uncounted hands you
        some armor.
