    - 'At the center of the room is a large boulder with spatters of crimson red
      around it. A few people kneel in front of it, in tears. You could overhear
      a few comments. '
    - '"They died so young." "How dare the Shifts use their deaths as a laughing
      stock for their fake religion."'
